flowchart TD
  accTitle: MOKS investigation workflow
  accDescr: The graph runs triage, logs and skills. With a model it enters a loop of plan and act, otherwise it runs rules. Plan goes to rules on a model or budget failure, to correlate when the budget is spent or no calls are returned, and to act when calls are returned. Act returns to plan unless the model said done or no call was new, when it goes to correlate. Rules goes to correlate, then report, then the end. After the graph, code verifies causes and stores the report.

  S((START)) --> triage["triage<br/>baseline: k8s_triage, prom_alerts"]
  triage --> logs["logs<br/>current and previous container logs"]
  logs --> skills["skills<br/>select up to 3, run read-only steps"]
  skills -->|"model configured"| plan
  skills -->|"no model"| rules
  plan["plan<br/>one model call, JSON tool requests"]
  plan -->|"tool calls returned"| act["act<br/>up to 4 calls through ToolExecutor"]
  act -->|"more to do"| plan
  act -->|"done=true, or no new call"| correlate
  plan -->|"no calls, or rounds or<br/>tool budget spent"| correlate
  plan -->|"LLMError or BudgetExceeded"| rules["rules<br/>detector-driven follow-ups"]
  rules --> correlate["correlate<br/>config audit, rightsizing, rollout timing"]
  correlate --> report["report<br/>model report, else rule-based report"]
  report --> E((END))
  E --> V["engine.py, after the graph<br/>verify_causes, coverage, skill contracts, store report"]

  classDef node fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#2e1065
  classDef term fill:#0f172a,stroke:#0f172a,color:#ffffff
  classDef own fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569,color:#0f172a
  class triage,logs,skills,plan,act,rules,correlate,report node
  class S,E term
  class V own
